1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,098
Speaking, task one. Topic 21: Holidays and celebrations. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:12,890
Which holiday do you like best?

3
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:21,823
I like Christmas best because the whole family is together.

4
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:24,232
How do you celebrate Christmas?

5
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:33,861
At Christmas we decorate the tree, cook and give each other presents.

6
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,317
What do you eat on Christmas Eve?

7
00:00:41,967 --> 00:00:44,890
On Christmas Eve we eat carp with potato salad.

8
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:47,586
Which Czech holidays do you know?

9
00:00:53,233 --> 00:00:56,888
I know Christmas, Easter and Czech Statehood Day.

10
00:00:57,733 --> 00:01:00,239
What is a typical holiday in your country?

11
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:09,973
In my country Easter is an important holiday; we bake Easter bread.

12
00:01:10,833 --> 00:01:12,738
How did you celebrate last New Year's Eve?

13
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:22,865
Last New Year's Eve we were at our friends' and at midnight we watched the fireworks.

14
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,448
When did you have a big celebration?

15
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:34,807
We had a big celebration at my brother's wedding last summer.

16
00:01:35,667 --> 00:01:37,624
Do you give presents at Easter?

17
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,608
We give the children chocolate eggs and small presents.

18
00:01:47,467 --> 00:01:49,606
How will you celebrate Christmas this year?

19
00:01:55,267 --> 00:01:58,791
This Christmas we'll celebrate at home; my parents are coming.

20
00:01:59,633 --> 00:02:02,191
Which holiday would you like to experience in another country?

21
00:02:07,833 --> 00:02:09,999
I'd like to experience the carnival in Italy.

22
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:21,463
Great! Practise topic 21 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website; the link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
